WEBVTT

00:08.100 --> 00:11.710
Koi seyo shounen shoujo tachi

00:11.710 --> 00:14.940
Kirari hitomi ni hoshi irete

00:15.210 --> 00:18.920
Umareta manma no jounetsu ga

00:18.920 --> 00:21.680
Hibana chirasu Jungle Haré nochi Guu

00:22.390 --> 00:26.190
Mekurumeku koshitsuki MUCHO

00:26.190 --> 00:29.350
Kodomo nya kiwadoi AMIGO

00:29.690 --> 00:33.090
Kisu shitara suikomaresou

00:33.230 --> 00:35.930
Kowai mono mitasa TONIGHT

00:36.900 --> 00:38.900
Ojikeduitara dame

00:38.900 --> 00:40.540
Oshite osarete GOING

00:40.540 --> 00:42.330
Dokkiri kibun ga iine

00:42.440 --> 00:43.800
Chakkari asa made DANCING

00:44.470 --> 00:46.040
LOVE LOVE LOVE

00:46.040 --> 00:49.500
TROPICANA

00:51.480 --> 00:54.920
Yashi no kokage de tsukamaete

00:54.920 --> 00:58.320
Jirashite tokoton tokoton

00:58.590 --> 01:02.020
Gomen ne anata wa mou toriko

01:02.020 --> 01:05.390
Nigerarenai Jungle Haré nochi Guu!

01:05.900 --> 01:09.500
Koi seyo shounen shoujo tachi

01:09.500 --> 01:12.830
Kirari hitomi ni hoshi irete

01:13.100 --> 01:16.270
Umareta manma no jounetsu ga

01:16.270 --> 01:19.900
Hibana chirasu Jungle Haré nochi Guu!

01:23.850 --> 01:25.140
A wild horse!

01:25.250 --> 01:26.510
Oh no!

01:40.460 --> 01:41.060
Ah, very nice, very nice.

01:41.060 --> 01:43.190
Oh no!
Ah, very nice, very nice.

01:45.030 --> 01:45.660
My lord!

01:45.940 --> 01:47.130
It's a rebellion!

01:52.610 --> 01:55.810
Boy! My boy!

01:55.810 --> 01:57.780
Oh, my boy!

01:58.250 --> 01:59.710
Haré!

02:01.980 --> 02:03.320
Haré!?

02:05.660 --> 02:06.520
Haré!

02:08.860 --> 02:09.590
Haré!

02:10.530 --> 02:12.300
Let's take a bath together!

02:12.300 --> 02:13.100
I don't wanna.

02:13.100 --> 02:13.930
Why?

02:14.960 --> 02:17.520
I'm already 10 years old. It's embarrassing.

02:17.800 --> 02:20.230
Oh, oh, you're acting all mature now.

02:20.300 --> 02:23.300
Yeah.
That's why I'm going to bathe by myself.

02:24.870 --> 02:28.240
Then, fine.
I'll take a bath with Guu-chan then!

02:28.780 --> 02:30.370
Yeah, yeah, go ahead.

02:30.980 --> 02:32.450
To you, Haré...

02:34.550 --> 02:36.250
Now, Guu-chan, let's go!

02:43.260 --> 02:44.750
Oh, no!

02:46.930 --> 02:48.900
Geez, so irresponsible...

02:49.170 --> 02:50.830
At least clean up after yourself.

02:53.300 --> 02:58.070
Well, it's a good thing that Mom is attached
to Guu now.

02:58.470 --> 02:59.570
Before, it was like...

02:59.640 --> 03:01.780
We're going to take a bath!

03:01.780 --> 03:04.270
When I say we're going together, I mean it!

03:04.350 --> 03:07.150
You know what will happen
if you don't come with me, right?

03:07.350 --> 03:09.940
She doesn't hang all over me anymore.

03:10.050 --> 03:11.680
Oh, wow, Guu-chan!

03:11.750 --> 03:13.450
You're more voluptuous than I thought.

03:13.590 --> 03:14.610
Voluptuous?

03:14.760 --> 03:16.690
How do you end up like that?

03:16.760 --> 03:18.020
I'm jealous!

03:21.700 --> 03:22.720
No way!

03:25.970 --> 03:27.630
What? Is something wrong?

03:28.270 --> 03:30.470
Oh, I feel refreshed!

03:32.510 --> 03:33.370
Mom...

03:34.340 --> 03:36.370
Please,
don't drink it like you're drinking milk.

03:36.450 --> 03:37.410
Or rather, put some clothes on!

03:37.480 --> 03:38.810
What are you talking about?

03:38.810 --> 03:40.300
It's only perverted
because you keep hiding it!

03:40.420 --> 03:42.380
I don't think that's the problem.

03:42.490 --> 03:45.610
What? You don't even want to bathe with me.

03:45.690 --> 03:46.850
You're trying to pick a fight with me!

03:46.920 --> 03:49.250
Are you saying
you can't follow what your mother says?

03:49.360 --> 03:52.120
Oh, all right,
at least don't go outside like that.

03:52.400 --> 03:54.190
Looking at you like that makes me
embarrassed!

03:54.260 --> 03:55.590
Oh, I feel refreshed...

04:02.240 --> 04:05.330
What, you actually took a bath with all your
clothes on?

04:05.540 --> 04:06.600
Indeed.

04:06.710 --> 04:09.230
No "Indeed's..." Why?

04:10.950 --> 04:12.480
Among the younger generation...

04:12.480 --> 04:16.750
...it has become a huge fad lately to bathe
with all their clothing on.

04:16.850 --> 04:17.610
Huh?

04:17.690 --> 04:20.180
You know, you can tell a better lie than that...

04:20.260 --> 04:21.920
Are you just joking?

04:22.430 --> 04:24.450
Can it be that you didn't know?

04:24.790 --> 04:25.160
Eh?

04:28.130 --> 04:29.530
That's ridiculous.

04:30.070 --> 04:32.900
Besides, Mom has been bathing stark naked
until now.

04:33.240 --> 04:35.400
Hey, that fad is a lie, right?

04:35.500 --> 04:38.130
Well, I'm not one to follow all the trends...

04:38.470 --> 04:40.910
In the first place, it's disgusting to bathe with
your clothes on!

04:41.080 --> 04:42.310
It doesn't feel like you've taken a bath!

04:43.110 --> 04:44.480
You don't even know how it feels.

04:45.350 --> 04:47.510
It's a lie, right!
I'm not going to believe you!

04:47.780 --> 04:51.010
If you think it's a lie,
you can ask everyone tomorrow.

04:51.120 --> 04:52.850
Yeah! I'll go ahead and ask them!

04:53.160 --> 04:54.380
I'll make sure to ask them!

04:54.690 --> 04:55.880
Go ahead and do so!

04:56.030 --> 04:57.930
You two get along so well together.

04:57.990 --> 05:02.120
I was so worried whether or not you'd get
along when I first decided that we'd live
together.

05:02.400 --> 05:04.730
You liar! You made the decision way before
you started to worry!

05:05.600 --> 05:09.560
When tomorrow comes, everyone will be
saying, "Guu is a strange girl!"

05:13.440 --> 05:16.410
Viva Non-Non

05:19.580 --> 05:21.110
Though I said that...

05:21.750 --> 05:26.750
Come to think of it, if I asked something so
ordinary like, "You don't bathe with your
clothes on, right?"

05:26.920 --> 05:28.550
Huh? What's up with that?

05:28.760 --> 05:31.120
What nonsense are you talking about?

05:31.190 --> 05:33.160
You sure say strange things!

05:33.700 --> 05:35.530
Haré, you're a strange guy!

05:38.070 --> 05:40.500
I'm going to be the one who gets treated as
the strange one!

05:40.870 --> 05:43.360
Forget it! I'm not going to ask!

05:44.570 --> 05:48.440
But, if what Guu said was right, and the fad
is to bathe with your clothes on...

05:48.440 --> 05:50.670
...and they found out that I was the only one
who didn't know...

05:50.810 --> 05:54.680
Eh? Can it be that
you've still been bathing naked?

05:54.780 --> 05:56.810
I didn't know there still
was someone that did that!

05:56.920 --> 05:57.720
You're kidding...

05:57.790 --> 05:59.190
So unfashionable!

06:02.220 --> 06:04.190
That would be more humiliating.

06:04.290 --> 06:05.420
Hey!

06:07.060 --> 06:09.270
What's wrong, Haré? You look pale.

06:09.270 --> 06:10.860
Are you worried about something?

06:11.230 --> 06:12.060
He's got plenty of worries.

06:13.000 --> 06:14.260
It's nothing.

06:14.770 --> 06:17.100
What's wrong?
You're not going to ask about the bath?

06:17.440 --> 06:19.600
Shut up! I'm still thinking about it!

06:19.840 --> 06:22.240
All right, I'll give you an opportunity to ask.

06:22.340 --> 06:23.900
Wait just a minute!

06:26.050 --> 06:27.610
Hey!

06:27.950 --> 06:31.080
Is someone out there kind enough to listen?

06:34.290 --> 06:34.920
Huh?

06:35.720 --> 06:36.750
What's going on?

06:36.860 --> 06:39.330
Haré apparently
has something to ask all of you.

06:39.960 --> 06:41.550
Nothing, it's nothing!

06:44.370 --> 06:46.770
Huh? Where's Haré and Guu?

06:46.870 --> 06:48.170
They went home early.

06:48.240 --> 06:50.330
Or rather, they disappeared
before they got to school.

06:50.810 --> 06:51.830
Geez.

06:51.940 --> 06:54.500
I hope they're not taking school too lightly.

06:54.840 --> 06:57.040
And so, first period is a siesta!

06:57.110 --> 06:58.880
You're the one that takes school the lightest!

07:03.890 --> 07:05.790
Why aren't you asking everyone?

07:05.990 --> 07:08.460
It's not that I have to ask everyone about it.

07:08.460 --> 07:10.120
One or two of them is enough.

07:10.460 --> 07:13.450
Well, you don't want to get embarrassed in
front of a crowd.

07:13.630 --> 07:15.260
If you understand why, don't ask!

07:25.140 --> 07:25.660
Hah!

07:25.940 --> 07:26.570
L!

07:26.640 --> 07:27.230
M!

07:27.310 --> 07:27.800
L!

07:27.880 --> 07:28.470
S!

07:28.540 --> 07:29.140
L!

07:29.210 --> 07:29.730
M!

07:30.050 --> 07:30.600
S!

07:30.850 --> 07:31.340
L!

07:31.480 --> 07:32.110
M!

07:32.180 --> 07:32.700
S!

07:35.350 --> 07:36.440
LL!

07:38.120 --> 07:38.950
That's right!

07:39.050 --> 07:42.320
I can ask the elder what
Toposte does in the bath!

07:42.960 --> 07:44.430
Oh, that chest-hair guy...

07:44.530 --> 07:45.550
Go ahead.

07:45.790 --> 07:47.130
Are you going to rip it off him again?

07:47.360 --> 07:48.660
No, I won't go after all.

07:48.730 --> 07:49.100
Damn.

07:49.330 --> 07:52.990
In the first place, if I went asking around,
Mom will find out that I ditched school today.

07:53.070 --> 07:54.230
That's not good.

07:54.540 --> 07:57.330
Someone that I can ask that's in school...

08:01.140 --> 08:03.610
I really don't want to do this,
but I have no choice.

08:05.650 --> 08:06.210
Oh?

08:06.280 --> 08:07.650
Oh, it's just my son.

08:07.720 --> 08:09.310
Don't call me your son!

08:10.190 --> 08:12.850
I mean, I don't know your name.

08:13.160 --> 08:14.550
And I don't care to remember it, either.

08:14.660 --> 08:15.820
You're the worst!

08:16.430 --> 08:17.590
So, what is it? What do you want?

08:17.690 --> 08:20.130
Well, there was something I wanted to ask...

08:21.300 --> 08:22.990
Even the school doctor studies?

08:23.070 --> 08:24.160
I have a slightly better
impression of you now.

08:24.530 --> 08:26.760
I can get pretty aroused by this.

08:27.100 --> 08:29.730
There are so many perverted words in it.

08:29.810 --> 08:30.740
You're the worst!

08:31.110 --> 08:32.660
You really are the worst!

08:32.980 --> 08:34.310
Is that so?

08:34.380 --> 08:36.610
I have no wish to talk to you, either. Go away.

08:37.910 --> 08:39.900
You really hate me that much?

08:40.020 --> 08:41.070
I hate you.

08:41.450 --> 08:43.610
I don't know how I produced a kid like you.

08:43.720 --> 08:45.190
It's the worst thing that can happen to me.

08:45.390 --> 08:47.120
I hate you, too!

08:47.460 --> 08:51.550
Now, now, I'll lend you Weda for 2 or 3 days,
so can you listen to what he has to say?

08:52.130 --> 08:54.060
Why are you lending someone else's mom
without asking first!?

08:54.730 --> 08:57.900
If Weda isn't home, the house will be quiet,
the rooms will stay neat...

08:57.900 --> 08:59.770
...and you can play all the games you want.

08:59.940 --> 09:01.700
All right, how about a few days?

09:01.840 --> 09:04.170
Hey, don't you get suckered into it, too...

09:05.040 --> 09:07.510
You're right. I guess it's no good.

09:07.880 --> 09:09.780
No, it's totally okay!

09:09.780 --> 09:11.270
You can ask me anything!

09:12.610 --> 09:13.340
Hey!

09:13.680 --> 09:15.010
A frog's son is also a frog.

09:17.050 --> 09:18.040
Hm...

09:18.120 --> 09:19.780
Bathing with your clothes on...

09:19.890 --> 09:21.860
I've never heard of it.

09:21.920 --> 09:24.420
See? You're the strange one!

09:24.530 --> 09:29.690
But, if that's a fad here in the jungle, there's
no way that I'd know about it.

09:30.100 --> 09:32.470
I just came here from the city.

09:32.870 --> 09:37.360
If you're that worried about it, it's faster to
see with your own eyes than to ask people.

09:37.810 --> 09:39.300
You mean to peep on someone?

09:39.580 --> 09:41.040
Oh, how perverted!

09:41.110 --> 09:43.040
I didn't say such a thing!

09:43.110 --> 09:45.510
Then, what do you mean,
see it with my own eyes!?

09:45.680 --> 09:48.050
You just have to take a bath
with a female friend.

09:48.120 --> 09:49.580
That's even more perverted!

09:49.650 --> 09:51.480
In the first place, why does it have to be a
female friend!?

09:51.590 --> 09:54.180
That's that... You know, service.

09:54.360 --> 09:55.480
That's common sense.

09:56.160 --> 09:57.150
You guys are the worst...

09:57.660 --> 10:01.250
Well, that's about all the advice
I can give as a father.

10:01.400 --> 10:04.200
What part of that was advice as a father?

10:04.370 --> 10:05.260
Let's go home, Guu!

10:05.370 --> 10:07.730
It was a mistake to ask you in the first place!

10:07.840 --> 10:10.170
I listened to what you had to say because
you told me to.

10:10.240 --> 10:12.000
That's pretty awful of you to say that.

10:12.140 --> 10:13.110
You good-for-nothing!

10:13.180 --> 10:14.840
Hey, what about renting out Weda-chan?

10:16.480 --> 10:20.540
How he can be ill-natured, and how he
doesn't listen to others...

10:21.350 --> 10:22.840
So, we are alike after all?

10:23.220 --> 10:24.850
Good morning!

10:24.950 --> 10:25.850
Huh?

10:26.020 --> 10:28.150
Didn't both of you
get permission to leave early?

10:28.360 --> 10:29.650
No, we just had something to do.

10:29.960 --> 10:31.190
But more than that, teacher...

10:31.830 --> 10:32.790
What is that?

10:34.400 --> 10:36.300
It's a surprising, wonderful mecha...

10:36.300 --> 10:37.660
...or the shogun's idea...

10:37.830 --> 10:40.200
...or it's a pending utility model...

10:40.370 --> 10:42.630
I call it the Anti-Dozing Device!

10:42.940 --> 10:45.600
Though, if something goes wrong, it looks
like I can fall into an eternal slumber.

10:46.910 --> 10:49.610
And so, about the picnic tomorrow...

10:50.050 --> 10:51.070
I'm handing out the fliers.

10:52.580 --> 10:54.410
Where are we going?

10:58.420 --> 11:00.320
We're going to the Jungle Bath.

11:00.420 --> 11:02.790
Yay! The Jungle Bath!

11:02.860 --> 11:03.620
Bath?

11:04.460 --> 11:05.790
Bathing with a female friend.

11:06.030 --> 11:06.960
I can't do that!

11:07.030 --> 11:09.500
What, Haré, are you expecting something?

11:11.070 --> 11:13.430
We're gathering on the school playground at
8:00AM tomorrow.

11:13.540 --> 11:14.560
Don't be late!

11:14.770 --> 11:16.240
Okay!

11:17.710 --> 11:18.640
Hey, Guu.

11:19.340 --> 11:22.470
I'm going to swing by Marie's place after
school, so you can go home ahead of me.

11:22.540 --> 11:25.010
I see. You are going to take a bath after all...

11:25.110 --> 11:26.780
I'm just going to ask her!

11:30.750 --> 11:34.280
I'm sure Marie is the only one that would
answer me without making fun of me.

11:34.390 --> 11:35.220
I see.

11:35.290 --> 11:39.700
By confessing one of your biggest secrets,
you are going to pressure her.

11:39.700 --> 11:43.190
And using that,
you're going to turn her into an accomplice!

11:43.930 --> 11:44.670
OK!

11:44.670 --> 11:45.500
As I just said!

11:45.770 --> 11:47.330
What, you have a question?

11:47.570 --> 11:51.270
Well, as I said,
does a banana count as a snack?

11:51.810 --> 11:53.740
Haré, that question...

11:55.040 --> 11:55.770
Eh?

11:56.010 --> 11:57.440
That's such an old gag!

11:57.510 --> 11:59.210
I didn't think anyone would actually say that!

11:59.280 --> 12:01.220
You're so out of it!

12:19.070 --> 12:22.230
Come to think of it,
I've never been to Marie's room before.

12:22.370 --> 12:26.710
I never found a reason to go because I heard
she lived at school with our teacher...

12:28.180 --> 12:29.170
Is this it?

12:29.340 --> 12:32.070
It looks like a preschool room,
so this must be it.

12:32.510 --> 12:34.280
Hey, Marie, are you here?

12:34.380 --> 12:35.370
It's me, Haré!

12:35.480 --> 12:36.710
Yes, yes?

12:37.220 --> 12:38.780
Hello, Marie.

12:43.030 --> 12:43.820
W-What?

12:44.130 --> 12:45.750
Why are you soaked, Marie?

12:45.860 --> 12:47.890
Because you came to visit so suddenly.

12:48.130 --> 12:50.100
I-I-I-I-I-It can't be a bath?

12:50.200 --> 12:52.760
That's right. I came jumping out of the bath.

12:53.700 --> 12:54.790
Just as I thought!

12:55.340 --> 12:56.830
I'm so soaked!

12:57.110 --> 12:58.540
W-What's going on?

12:58.610 --> 13:02.440
To think that, just like Guu said, wearing your
clothes in the bath is a fad.

13:02.640 --> 13:04.810
I was doing the laundry, and I got splashed
with so much water.

13:04.880 --> 13:06.940
I really hate the plumbing here!

13:07.680 --> 13:08.480
Haré?

13:08.720 --> 13:10.050
Didn't you have something to ask?

13:10.850 --> 13:12.750
No, it's all right now...

13:24.500 --> 13:27.470
Even Marie was taking a bath fully clothed...

13:27.800 --> 13:30.170
Oh, geez! Cut it out, Chet!

13:30.310 --> 13:32.910
Here's a shower!

13:32.910 --> 13:34.640
It's cold!

13:34.710 --> 13:37.240
Oh, it's cold?
Then I'll give you some more of it!

13:37.810 --> 13:39.550
I'm telling you, stop it!

13:39.550 --> 13:40.780
I don't wanna!

13:40.780 --> 13:41.440
Geez!

13:42.280 --> 13:46.740
If you're that worried about it, it's faster to
see it with your own eyes than to ask people.

13:48.090 --> 13:49.490
With my own eyes...

13:53.900 --> 13:55.260
I won't do such a thing!

13:55.830 --> 13:57.230
If I do, I'd end up just like him!

14:01.970 --> 14:05.930
But, if they're still fully clothed, it would
mean that it's all right to peek in on them.

14:06.010 --> 14:07.670
It's not such a serious crime.

14:08.140 --> 14:10.240
But, to act according to what he says!

14:10.310 --> 14:12.440
That's the part that
I hate the most about this!

14:13.850 --> 14:15.340
Chet, you meanie!

14:16.420 --> 14:18.750
Come chase me if you can!

14:19.050 --> 14:20.150
Chet!

14:20.360 --> 14:21.520
Geez, you're so cruel!

14:26.060 --> 14:28.360
Oh, what's wrong, Haré?
What are you doing there?

14:28.460 --> 14:29.520
Sorry about that.

14:29.600 --> 14:32.290
We were fooling around in the bath, and
couldn't control ourselves.

14:32.370 --> 14:34.460
What? You're the one at fault, Chet!

14:35.500 --> 14:37.470
Your angry face is wonderful, too.

14:39.910 --> 14:41.210
Where's Haré?

14:47.320 --> 14:50.380
Perhaps he couldn't tolerate
our passionate glances.

14:50.450 --> 14:53.260
Geez! No more fooling around
while we clean up the bath!

14:53.260 --> 14:54.020
Yup, yup.

14:59.460 --> 15:02.160
I don't want to go to the picnic...

15:02.700 --> 15:06.130
It's strange after all to take a bath with your
clothes on.

15:06.130 --> 15:09.040
Even if it's a fad, I don't know about it...

15:16.650 --> 15:19.510
That's right, I'll come up with some reason to
be absent.

15:19.510 --> 15:20.210
That's it!

15:20.280 --> 15:22.840
Yeah, that's it, I just have to be absent.

15:22.920 --> 15:24.410
Geez, that's so easy!

15:25.950 --> 15:27.050
I'm home.

15:27.160 --> 15:28.850
Welcome back!

15:31.130 --> 15:33.620
Look, look at this new lunchbox!

15:33.860 --> 15:36.630
I'll make you the best-ever lunch tomorrow!

15:37.170 --> 15:37.890
Why?

15:38.800 --> 15:43.140
Why is a woman who is fine with making her
son do all the cooking and cleaning, down to
washing her underwear...

15:43.140 --> 15:44.260
...doing this all of a sudden?

15:45.510 --> 15:48.870
Silly, a lunch is a given!

15:48.940 --> 15:52.080
Weda is usually lethargic, but she really
loves special events.

15:52.080 --> 15:53.910
Oh, Guu-chan, don't compliment me!

15:53.980 --> 15:54.950
She's not complimenting you.

15:56.220 --> 15:59.050
Now, I'll do a number!

16:06.430 --> 16:07.900
M-Mom, it's okay.

16:07.960 --> 16:09.870
Actually, about the picnic tomorrow, I was
planning on n...

16:09.870 --> 16:11.660
No! I'm going to make this lunch!

16:11.770 --> 16:13.870
Then, make the shrimp gratin like usual...

16:13.870 --> 16:17.130
No, if I give up now, I'll tarnish
the name of all household wives!

16:17.210 --> 16:18.970
You don't have a name to tarnish.

16:20.180 --> 16:23.580
When I'm serious, I can make a lunch or two!

16:24.410 --> 16:25.610
I'm really serious this time!

16:26.150 --> 16:28.950
Ouch! Ouch! Ouch!

16:29.380 --> 16:32.150
After all, love is the best spice of them all.

16:32.350 --> 16:34.150
I think it might taste like something else.

16:34.220 --> 16:35.220
How about it, Haré?

16:35.220 --> 16:37.490
Now don't you have more things to look
forward to at the picnic?

16:42.800 --> 16:43.770
Y-Yeah...

16:44.600 --> 16:46.430
Now, you can't possibly say
that you're not going.

16:47.900 --> 16:49.930
Ouch! Ouch! Ouch!

16:55.080 --> 16:56.510
I was able to get up!

16:58.210 --> 16:59.610
Are all of you here?

16:59.750 --> 17:00.810
We're going now!

17:00.950 --> 17:02.080
Yeah!

17:05.690 --> 17:06.850
What's wrong, Haré?

17:06.920 --> 17:10.380
Well, Mom made me a lunch...

17:12.330 --> 17:13.420
Here!

17:14.400 --> 17:15.800
T-Thanks!

17:16.770 --> 17:18.390
Have a good trip!

17:23.710 --> 17:26.070
I'm jealous. A lunch made by your mom.

17:26.140 --> 17:27.670
It puts a warm fuzzy feeling in my heart.

17:28.640 --> 17:31.340
I'm nervous about what she put into it.

17:31.580 --> 17:34.070
It's boring to make your own.

17:36.820 --> 17:38.790
I see. You made your own, Marie...

17:39.020 --> 17:43.080
Lunches, cleaning, laundry...
I have to do everything by myself.

17:44.430 --> 17:47.020
What selfish things have I been saying?

17:47.500 --> 17:48.660
I'm such a loser!

17:49.500 --> 17:51.270
I make mistakes every so often...

17:51.270 --> 17:53.890
Just like that laundry yesterday.

17:54.240 --> 17:55.730
Hey, Haré, are you listening?

17:59.040 --> 17:59.900
Marie!

18:01.540 --> 18:04.380
We're already here, so it's our loss if we don't
enjoy ourselves, right?

18:04.610 --> 18:05.880
Y-Yeah.

18:06.080 --> 18:08.280
Let's go to the Jungle Bath!

18:09.820 --> 18:11.120
I wonder what it's like.

18:11.320 --> 18:12.480
Same here!

18:12.550 --> 18:13.650
We're not there yet?

18:13.790 --> 18:15.760
I went there with my family once.

18:15.760 --> 18:16.990
I have such fond memories of it...

18:17.090 --> 18:18.820
Oh, is that so?

18:23.630 --> 18:25.730
Hey now, he leaves after just one line?

18:25.730 --> 18:28.170
It's been a while since he last showed up!

18:28.300 --> 18:29.430
He doesn't have to show up!

18:35.940 --> 18:37.710
Meet back here at 2:00PM to go home!

18:37.980 --> 18:39.170
Now, on your way!

18:39.250 --> 18:40.010
Okay!

18:40.320 --> 18:42.250
We first should head to the main jungle bath!

18:42.350 --> 18:44.720
I want to go to the ocean floor bath!

18:45.120 --> 18:46.280
Now, smile!

18:47.520 --> 18:48.750
I got a big catch!

18:48.860 --> 18:50.950
Hey, Marie, did you bring a hair dryer?

18:51.030 --> 18:51.930
Just in case.

18:51.930 --> 18:53.830
Thank goodness!
If you don't mind, can I borrow it?

18:53.900 --> 18:54.490
Sure!

18:58.000 --> 18:58.990
Well, good luck.

18:59.100 --> 19:00.290
Wait, you're going off somewhere!?

19:01.540 --> 19:05.630
If you kneel, and beg me with a teary look,
I'll think about staying.

19:05.870 --> 19:06.700
Go.

19:29.700 --> 19:30.530
Haré!

19:30.530 --> 19:31.860
Over here, over here!

19:34.840 --> 19:38.470
I guess I'll join the fad, though slightly late...

19:49.150 --> 19:52.310
This is pretty good in its own way.

19:53.790 --> 19:55.380
Haré, you...

19:57.830 --> 19:59.920
Why are you bathing with clothes on?

20:00.000 --> 20:01.390
You're so strange!

20:02.100 --> 20:03.030
Strange!

20:07.170 --> 20:08.290
Uh, this is...

20:13.840 --> 20:14.640
G-Guu!

20:14.740 --> 20:18.110
Damn you! Nobody was wearing clothes in
the bath!

20:19.280 --> 20:21.650
Of course it was all a lie.

20:24.550 --> 20:27.190
Things like this happen to
everyone once or twice.

20:27.190 --> 20:28.050
Don't worry about it.

20:28.160 --> 20:28.920
I will!

20:29.190 --> 20:32.020
Fine, I'll go off on my own for a bath!

20:34.900 --> 20:35.950
That way is...

20:38.930 --> 20:40.300
Premonitions of a commotion...

20:43.470 --> 20:46.340
I was stupid to believe what Guu had to say,
even for a moment!

20:46.710 --> 20:48.680
I'll never believe her again!

21:00.620 --> 21:01.780
Oh, Haré!

21:02.220 --> 21:03.850
Can you grab that ball?

21:16.200 --> 21:17.100
Haré?

21:17.570 --> 21:19.770
What's wrong, Haré?

21:20.180 --> 21:21.270
The ball!

22:35.420 --> 22:36.420
NEXT EPISODE

22:36.420 --> 22:38.490
Wah, you surprised me!
What is it, Mom, all of a sudden?

22:38.490 --> 22:40.020
A birthday? Whose? Oh, mine!

22:40.020 --> 22:42.520
I totally had forgotten... I wonder why?
Well, I'm sure it's 100% her fault.

22:42.520 --> 22:44.690
Mom is cooking something up,
everyone in my class is celebrating...

22:44.690 --> 22:45.860
My birthday sure seems the best!

22:45.860 --> 22:45.990
My birthday sure seems the best!

22:45.990 --> 22:48.600
Doc, you're giving me a gift, too?
Hey, you're a pretty good guy!

22:48.600 --> 22:49.530
What is it? A book?

22:49.530 --> 22:50.900
A book really seems like a gift from a dad...

22:50.900 --> 22:51.770
Hey wait a minute!

22:51.770 --> 22:53.470
In which world does a father give a porn
book to his son!?

22:53.470 --> 22:56.240
There are other things out there, aren't there!
I don't need something like this! ...for now.

22:56.240 --> 22:57.970
Eh? Guu, you're wondering if you need to
give me a gift as well?

22:57.970 --> 23:00.180
It's all right, the thought is enough.
Hey, wait, my voice is awfully low.

23:00.180 --> 23:00.440
Wait, this is?

23:00.440 --> 23:01.140
This is?

23:01.140 --> 23:01.680
Fantasy Jungle

23:01.680 --> 23:05.410
Next episode of Haré+Guu: Fantasy Jungle
